### 1. MCP ulanish qo'shish — server saqlash paytidayoq so'raladi
POST http://localhost:8080/api/mcp/connections
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Uysot CRM",
  "url": "https://mcp.uysot.uz/mcp",
  "authType": "BEARER",
  "secretKey": "UYSOT_MCP_TOKEN",
  "allowWrites": false
}

### 2. Ulanishlar ro'yxati — status, toolCount va usableToolCount bilan
GET http://localhost:8080/api/mcp/connections
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 3. Tool ro'yxatini qayta o'qish (server tool'lari o'zgargach yoki xatodan keyin)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/mcp/connections/1/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 4. Agentga biriktirish
POST http://localhost:8080/api/mcp/connections/1/agents/7
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 5. Agentdan ajratish
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/mcp/connections/1/agents/7
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 6. O'chirish
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/mcp/connections/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Platformaning o'z MCP serveri — initialize (Claude Code shunday ulanadi)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/mcp-server
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{api_key}}

{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "method": "initialize", "params": {"protocolVersion": "2025-06-18", "capabilities": {}, "clientInfo": {"name": "http-file", "version": "1"}}}

### MCP server — kalit ko'radigan tool'lar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/mcp-server
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{api_key}}

{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "method": "tools/list"}

### MCP server — evalni boshlash (keyin get_evaluation_run)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/mcp-server
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{api_key}}

{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "method": "tools/call", "params": {"name": "run_evaluation", "arguments": {"agentId": 1, "repeat": 3}}}
